This script implements the complete UCBF V13 validation pipeline with full
statistical analysis across three independent datasets:

1. SPARC (Spitzer Photometry and Accurate Rotation Curves)
   - 176 galaxies with full rotation curves
   - Baryonic components: gas, disk, bulge
