   - Computes: Mean & Median residuals for ALL and HIGH-QUALITY samples

2. MaNGA (Mapping Nearby Galaxies at Apache Point)
   - 1,432 galaxies with integrated rotation curve parameters
   - Data source: Arora+2026 (J/MNRAS/522/1208) via Vizier
   - 27-column catalog properly mapped to UCBF V13 parameters
   - Fits: Simplified vortex profile (1 parameter: r_t per galaxy)
   - Computes: Mean & Median residuals for FULL sample

