================================================================================

SPARC Quality Filters (Lelli & McGaugh 2016):
  ✓ Inclination between 30-80°
  ✓ At least 5 data points
  ✓ R_max > 2 × R_scale
  ✓ V_err / V_obs < 0.15

MaNGA Quality Filters:
  ✓ V_flat > 30 km/s (reliable rotation)
  ✓ r_max > 0.5 kpc (resolved)
  ✓ V_flat < 500 km/s (remove outliers)

Clusters: All clusters are high-quality X-ray selected samples

